load @term/seed/code/structure/set
  find set

# Graph theory: the study of networks, of vertices joined by edges, the mathematics of connection. Paths, cycles,
# colorings, and connectivity are its subjects. The Dynkin diagram is a graph, the Fano plane wiring the octonions is a
# graph, and the mesh of the substrate is a graph whose vertices are cells. The form carries the set of vertices; the
# edges are the connections.
form graph
  link vertices, like set
